{{Documentation}}
This module exists to standardise getting the names of renamed cats, and comes with logging to bucket and adding a page warning when previewing.

== Usage ==
<syntaxhighlight lang="lua">
-- top-level declaration
local get_renamed = require('Module:Get renamed cat').get_renamed_unit_data

	-- inside a function
	local name = ...
	---@type BucketData?
	local data = some_func(name)
	if not data then
		data = get_renamed(name)
	end
	local cat = Cat.from_bucket_data(data)
</syntaxhighlight>

=== Legacy ===
There is a legacy function <code>p.get_renamed_unit(renames, names)</code>. Probably don't use this.

== Data ==
Renames are editable at [[Module:Cat renames/names]]. [[Module:Cat renames]] handles translating that format to bucket data.